# SWX_RT_HEAP_RESERVE=1: heap arenas for transient render targets.
# The stock recycled list serves any texture from any fitting heap, so a target
# that grows by a Metal size step takes a new heap each time. H1 keeps automatic
# MTLHeap arenas holding several live render targets each: Metal packs textures
# and reuses freed space. Arenas are keyed only by heap compatibility
# (storage/cache/hazard modes); format, dimensions, MSAA, levels and usage never
# separate them. A compatible arena with room takes the target (arena hit);
# when all are full a new arena opens at round_up(max(16 MB, 2 x need), 1 MB),
# at most 64 MB per arena. Past 256 MB of backing (active and idle alike), or
# when Metal makes nothing, the stock path runs and nothing is retained. The
# reservation holds the budget while Metal works, and Metal's rounding is
# validated before insert: a heap landing past the cap is rejected without
# entering the array or the set. Fence
# safety is explicit: every submit-thread tex_mtl_ return stamps the owner's
# retire fence (g_fence + 1); the arena observes the max over live targets and
# is evicted only with no live targets, fence completed, 3 s idle. A new arena
# is inserted not-ready and becomes visible only after res_add, so no target
# escapes without residency. An arena
# enters the residency set exactly once and leaves exactly once on evict.
# Only private RenderTarget descriptors qualify (ShaderWrite-only compute
# intermediates stay stock); image families, storage pairs and snapshots keep
# the stock path. Default off; aggregate counters only (power-line log: arenas
# new, hits, full, active, idle, live targets, backing MB, fallback, evicted;
# eligible, stock reused, stock made in both arms; top-3 shapes on new). A/B
# via ab_test.py rt-heap-reserve (=0 restores the stock path).
# verify: dm/gfx/nvn/nvn_mtl.m:SWX_RT_HEAP_RESERVE
# verify: dm/gfx/nvn/nvn_mtl.m:NvRtArenaRef
# verify: dm/gfx/nvn/nvn_mtl.m:RTH_MAX_ARENAS
# verify: dm/gfx/nvn/nvn_mtl.m:void mtl_rth_stats
# verify: dm/gfx/nvn/nvn_mtl.m:rth_place(MTLTextureDescriptor *d)
# verify: dm/gfx/nvn/nvn_mtl.m:rth_use_note
# verify: dm/gfx/nvn/nvn_mtl.m:rth_release
# verify: dm/gfx/nvn/nvn_mtl.m:rth_trim();   // the arena reserve idles out on the same clock
# verify: dm/gfx/nvn/hle_nvn.c:rt-heap up to frame
